{"ticker":"SMR","updated":"2026-11-14T01:25:43Z","profile":{"longName":"NuScale Power Corporation","shortName":"NuScale Power Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nuscalepower.com","fullTimeEmployees":428,"marketCap":1913122688,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-6.951904,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":701.0343,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":8.59375,"targetHighPrice":19.0,"targetLowPrice":3.5,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.966,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":-0.02162,"operatingMargins":90.9945,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":2729000,"beta":2.429,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":23.45,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":4.275,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"NuScale Power Corporation provides small modular reactor technology solutions. It offers NuScale Power Module (NPM), a light water nuclear reactor that can generate 77 megawatts of electricity (MWe). The company also provides design and nuclear regulatory licensing basis information to construct and operate the power plant; and licensing, design, development, construction, operation, and maintenance of the power plant. In addition, it offers regulatory licensing support services; start-up testing and commissioning support; accredited training programs to support initial and ongoing power plant operations; management of all aspects of the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission required inspections, tests, analysis, and acceptance criteria process; NuScale Power Module mechanical handling; initial and ongoing fuel bundle loading and movement; design engineering management during commercial operation; operations and maintenance program management; procurement and spare parts management; nuclear fuel management, including reload analysis; and outage planning and execution support services. The company has a strategic partnership with Ebara Elliott Energy for the development, demonstration, and testing of industrial scale compressors using power modules. NuScale Power Corporation was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Corvallis, Oregon.","summary_zh":"NuScale Power Corporation 提供小型模組化反應器技術解決方案。它提供 NuScale 電源模組 (NPM)，這是一種可產生 77 兆瓦電力 (MWe) 的輕水核反應器。該公司還提供設計和核監管許可基礎資訊以建造和營運電廠；發電廠的許可、設計、開發、建造、營運和維護。此外，它還提供監管許可支援服務；啟動測試和調試支援；經認可的培訓計劃，以支援發電廠的初始和持續運營；管理美國核管理委員會所需的檢查、測試、分析和驗收標準流程的各個方面； NuScale 電源模組機械搬運；初始和持續的燃料束裝載和移動；商業運營期間的設計工程管理；該公司與 Ebara Elliott Energy 建立了戰略合作夥伴關係，致力於使用電源模組開發、演示和測試工業規模壓縮機。 NuScale Power Corporation 成立於 2007 年，總部位於俄勒岡州科瓦利斯。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":37.79,"h":39.46,"l":35.88,"c":39.09,"v":23182900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":38.3,"h":39.0,"l":36.76,"c":37.26,"v":16497200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":36.97,"h":37.0,"l":35.13,"c":36.13,"v":12722100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":37.28,"h":41.03,"l":36.35,"c":38.12,"v":25964600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":39.2,"h":47.0,"l":39.0,"c":46.77,"v":52070400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":44.7,"h":47.26,"l":42.25,"c":45.0,"v":26290400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":44.5,"h":44.7,"l":41.07,"c":41.64,"v":21098400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":42.25,"h":42.39,"l":39.21,"c":39.67,"v":16844500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":38.0,"h":39.248,"l":36.19,"c":37.7,"v":21368700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":38.0,"h":38.85,"l":36.96,"c":38.0,"v":12613200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":39.75,"h":40.328,"l":37.816,"c":38.16,"v":15753900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":37.295,"h":37.81,"l":35.92,"c":36.0,"v":20559300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":36.02,"h":37.05,"l":35.25,"c":36.61,"v":13151400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":37.39,"h":39.59,"l":36.96,"c":39.51,"v":18790600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":39.37,"h":41.25,"l":38.67,"c":40.12,"v":17498400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":41.515,"h":43.96,"l":41.32,"c":41.94,"v":18427900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":42.31,"h":44.2,"l":39.05,"c":39.21,"v":19406600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":39.86,"h":40.635,"l":37.922,"c":38.2,"v":15443400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":38.95,"h":41.605,"l":38.426,"c":40.61,"v":2207840